      "writtenOn": "2025-10-30T21:08:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not a sustainable way to address the problem.  Board specific files should not be directly pulling in common code like you\u0027ve done here.\n\nYou should fix the dependency for `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_THERMISTOR` instead.\n\n```\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_THERMISTOR\n\tdepends on DT_HAS_CROS_EC_THERMISTOR_ENABLED || \\\n    \t\tDT_HAS_CROS_EC_TEMP_SENSOR_APL6012_ENABLED\n```\n\nPlease submit a CL fix this the correct way.",
